  "description": "Overview An online hackathon at the intersection of Software Development and Quizzes & Treasure Hunt. About the Opportunity: The Coding Challenge 2026 is an online coding hackathon designed for team participation. This online coding challenge combines Software Development and Quizzes & Treasure Hunt, inviting participants to solve coding problems collaboratively. Participants can showcase skills in C++ Programming, Python, Data Structures and Algorithms, Problem-Solving, and Critical Thinking. This opportunity brings together technical ability, logical reasoning, and teamwork in a focused online challenge. Rewards and Prizes: 1st: Earn certificate recognition as the top-ranked participant or team. 2nd: Receive certificate recognition for achieving the second rank. 3rd: Receive certificate recognition for achieving the third rank. Bring your coding skills and team spirit to The Coding Challenge 2026 and take on the challenge online.",
