    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p><em>An online hackathon at the intersection of Software Development and Quizzes &amp; Treasure Hunt.</em></p>\n<p><strong>About the Opportunity:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Coding Challenge 2026 is an online coding hackathon designed for team participation. This online coding challenge combines Software Development and Quizzes &amp; Treasure Hunt, inviting participants to solve coding problems collaboratively.</li>\n<li>Participants can showcase skills in C++ Programming, Python, Data Structures and Algorithms, Problem-Solving, and Critical Thinking.</li>\n<li>This opportunity brings together technical ability, logical reasoning, and teamwork in a focused online challenge.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards and Prizes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1st:</strong> Earn certificate recognition as the top-ranked participant or team.</li>\n<li><strong>2nd:</strong> Receive certificate recognition for achieving the second rank.</li>\n<li><strong>3rd:</strong> Receive certificate recognition for achieving the third rank.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bring your coding skills and team spirit to The Coding Challenge 2026 and take on the challenge online.</p>",
